  "segments": [
   {
    "id": "t1",
    "start": 0.0,
    "end": 1.58,
    "text": "I lost 100 pounds in nine months."
   },
   {
    "id": "t2",
    "start": 1.58,
    "end": 3.1,
    "text": "I didn't step foot into the gym."
   },
   {
    "id": "t3",
    "start": 3.1,
    "end": 4.14,
    "text": "Believe me, when I tell you,"
   },
   {
    "id": "t4",
    "start": 4.14,
    "end": 5.34,
    "text": "I know what the fuck I'm doing."
   },
   {
    "id": "t5",
    "start": 5.34,
    "end": 6.62,
    "text": "And here's how I did it."
   },
   {
    "id": "t6",
    "start": 6.62,
    "end": 7.7,
    "text": "It was not easy."
   },
   {
    "id": "t7",
    "start": 7.7,
    "end": 10.88,
    "text": "Girls, I started eating them nasty fucking vegetables."
   },
   {
    "id": "t8",
    "start": 10.88,
    "end": 12.98,
    "text": "I stopped eating the shit that I like"
   },
   {
    "id": "t9",
    "start": 12.98,
    "end": 14.86,
    "text": "and I started eating literally,"
   },
   {
    "id": "t10",
    "start": 14.86,
    "end": 18.24,
    "text": "if it's not like vegetables, it wasn't easy."
   },
   {
    "id": "t11",
    "start": 18.24,
    "end": 19.08,
    "text": "I hated that shit."
   },
   {
    "id": "t12",
    "start": 19.08,
    "end": 20.44,
    "text": "You think I like celery?"
   },
   {
    "id": "t13",
    "start": 20.44,
    "end": 23.22,
    "text": "I didn't, but I love it now, okay?"
   },
   {
    "id": "t14",
    "start": 23.22,
    "end": 25.12,
    "text": "I started eating a shit ton of cucumbers,"
   },
   {
    "id": "t15",
    "start": 25.12,
    "end": 26.26,
    "text": "a shit ton of bell peppers,"
   },
   {
    "id": "t16",
    "start": 26.26,
    "end": 33.26,
    "text": "avocado and lettuce and cabbage and carrots. Oh, I still fucking hate carrots, but I do"
   },
   {
    "id": "t17",
    "start": 33.26,
    "end": 39.78,
    "text": "like a carrot juice. Okay. You have to get creative. Okay. Zero calorie condiments, mustard,"
   },
   {
    "id": "t18",
    "start": 39.78,
    "end": 44.82,
    "text": "sriracha, tahin, like all types of snow burgers. You can't hit that fast food. You can't go"
   },
   {
    "id": "t19",
    "start": 44.82,
    "end": 49.94,
    "text": "to McDonald's gruel. It's nasty and it's might not really be nasty, but you need to"
   },
   {
    "id": "t20",
    "start": 49.94,
    "end": 54.7,
    "text": "think that you are what you eat. So if you eat grease goblin, you will be grease goblin"
   },
   {
    "id": "t21",
    "start": 54.7,
    "end": 62.42,
    "text": "Point blank period don't worry about being hungry. I promise you that feeling goes away. You will stop being hungry after a while"
   },
   {
    "id": "t22",
    "start": 63.54,
    "end": 65.86,
    "text": "Probably like a week probably like two weeks, maybe"
   },
   {
    "id": "t23",
    "start": 66.46,
    "end": 71.1,
    "text": "But you need to eat a lot of vegetables and you need to drink a lot of water"
   },
   {
    "id": "t24",
    "start": 71.1,
    "end": 73.1,
    "text": "Okay, if you fuck up and you get a coffee"
   },
   {
    "id": "t25",
    "start": 73.62,
    "end": 80.2,
    "text": "There goes your calories girl. You drank that coffee. You put yourself in this boat now bitch sink or fucking swim"
   },
   {
    "id": "t26",
    "start": 80.2,
    "end": 82.2,
    "text": "You ain't about to eat no shit. You can't"
   },
   {
    "id": "t27",
    "start": 82.2,
    "end": 87.64,
    "text": "you can't you drink that coffee once you get past your addiction of food your"
   },
   {
    "id": "t28",
    "start": 87.64,
    "end": 93.12,
    "text": "food addiction you'll realize real life food ain't even my main priority food"
   },
   {
    "id": "t29",
    "start": 93.12,
    "end": 98.72,
    "text": "ain't even focused on food I'm gonna eat for function not for like taste and you"
   },
   {
    "id": "t30",
    "start": 98.72,
    "end": 102.28,
    "text": "can't have the best of both worlds okay nine times out of ten you can't be"
   },
   {
    "id": "t31",
    "start": 102.28,
    "end": 108.16,
    "text": "fucking you can't you can't weigh 130 pounds and be eating pizzas and burgers"
   },
   {
    "id": "t32",
    "start": 108.16,
    "end": 112.88,
    "text": "and stuff. They good. They real good. Love a pizza, love a burger. I'd be fucking up that"
   },
   {
    "id": "t33",
    "start": 112.88,
    "end": 119.12,
    "text": "Davis burgers. I can't lie. But I didn't fuck it up for a long time, for a long time. And then"
   },
   {
    "id": "t34",
    "start": 119.12,
    "end": 125.41,
    "text": "whenever I got back into it and I was like, okay, girl, you done, you done, you done lost all that"
   },
   {
    "id": "t35",
    "start": 125.41,
    "end": 131.25,
    "text": "way. But like, here's the thing, you can't eat again, or you're going to be fat again. No."
   },
   {
    "id": "t36",
    "start": 132.21,
    "end": 137.49,
    "text": "That's whenever I decided, okay, if I go out and I eat something real dirty for me,"
   },
   {
    "id": "t37",
    "start": 137.49,
    "end": 143.25,
    "text": "I'm gonna make sure I get that shit out. I'm gonna go to the gym. I'm going to drink a lot of water"
   },
   {
    "id": "t38",
